# sys-tor: transparent Tor gateway for every compartment attached to the cltor network.
# Clients on 10.152.152.0/24 never get a route to the internet; their TCP is redirected
# into TransPort and their DNS into DNSPort below. Each client address gets its own circuits.
SocksPort 10.152.152.1:9050 IsolateClientAddr IsolateDestAddr
TransPort 10.152.152.1:9040 IsolateClientAddr IsolateDestAddr
DNSPort 10.152.152.1:5353
VirtualAddrNetworkIPv4 10.192.0.0/10
AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
ClientUseIPv6 0
Log notice syslog
